WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.435
-Good evening,
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.003
This is "Late Night," we hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.437
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.437 --> 00:00:08.374
"The New York Times" has
published additional audio

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.377
of House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:12.512
and the aftermath
of the Capitol attack.

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:17.951
All right, how do we have this
much audio of Kevin McCarthy?

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:21.421
Pretty soon, we're gonna be able
to put out an E.P..

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:23.623
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:26.159
President Biden said yesterday
that his administration

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:29.128
is making progress on reducing
the national debt.

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:31.664
Oh, good, that was
definitely the thing I was

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.199
most worried about.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.700
[ Laughter ]
What about abortion,

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.202
the pandemic, climate change?

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.237
The Democrats are like the
people who offer

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:41.207
to bring the most boring
thing to a party.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:44.844
"Good news, everyone, the
napkins are here!"

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:50.049
[ Laughter ]
"The soiree can begin!"

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:52.818
President Biden warned yesterday
that the leaked opinion

00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:56.021
that indicated the Supreme Court
is prepared to overturn

00:00:56.021 --> 00:00:59.525
Roe v. Wade could threaten
other freedoms and said,

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:01.761
"What happens if you have states
change the laws

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:04.997
saying that children who are
LGBTQ can't be in classrooms

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:06.066
with other children?"

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.600
Said Republicans,
"Oh, hey, that's good.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.669
That's good."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:11.837
"What else you got?"

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:14.140
Florida Congressman Matt Gaetz
tweeted yesterday...

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:28.320
Which is pretty bold coming
from a guy

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:31.124
who does all his dating
on Venmo.

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:34.627
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.830
Several journalists across
multiple news outlets

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.833
have reportedly tested positive
for the coronavirus

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.569
after attending last weekend's

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:44.069
White House Correspondents'
Dinner.

00:01:44.069 --> 00:01:46.972
So all those articles about how
we're back to normal

00:01:46.972 --> 00:01:48.141
are gonna be a week late.

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:50.710
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:54.080
Donald Trump Jr. reportedly
met on Tuesday

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.915
with the House Committee
investigating

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:58.317
the Capitol attack remotely
for more than three hours.

00:01:58.317 --> 00:02:01.321
Three hours doesn't seem
very long,

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:03.756
but because it's Don Jr.,
it still came out

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.992
to like eight hours' worth
of testimony.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.327
-The media runs right away.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:08.761
It's Russian disinformation.

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.163
There's literally zero evidence

00:02:10.163 --> 00:02:11.231
that it's Russian dis--

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:17.570
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.806
-President Biden mistakenly said
at a White House event this week

00:02:20.806 --> 00:02:23.142
that there's never been
a senator from Delaware.

00:02:23.142 --> 00:02:25.578
While the GOP is trying
to convince us there's

00:02:25.578 --> 00:02:28.014
never been a congressman
from North Carolina.

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:29.815
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.815 --> 00:02:32.285
Sunday is Mother's Day,
which means today is

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:33.919
"I got plenty of time
to get a card."

00:02:33.919 --> 00:02:35.588
Tomorrow is
"I should get a card."

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.390
Saturday is
"What about an e-card?"

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:38.891
And Sunday is "I'm screwed."

00:02:38.891 --> 00:02:41.126
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.126 --> 00:02:43.663
Residents of Nantucket voted
yesterday to allow

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:46.098
everyone to go topless
on its beaches,

00:02:46.098 --> 00:02:48.768
bringing them one step closer
to finally living up

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:50.536
to their limericks.

00:02:50.536 --> 00:02:54.507
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:56.008
[ Applause ]

00:02:56.008 --> 00:03:02.381
An -- Yes, sometimes it takes
a minute for the limerick jokes

00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:05.318
to land.

00:03:05.318 --> 00:03:06.786
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:10.456
We'll be patient.

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:13.693
An otter was recently spotted
swimming in the Detroit River

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:15.561
for the first time
in over 100 years.

00:03:15.561 --> 00:03:18.498
But I'm willing to bet
that it's a different otter.

00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:24.170
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:27.339
And finally, the FDA is looking
at a new proposed rule

00:03:27.339 --> 00:03:28.808
to ban menthol cigarettes.

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:31.010
Here to talk about it is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:33.312
in a segment called
"Is This Racist?"

00:03:33.312 --> 00:03:37.583
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:41.120
-The FDA is going to ban
menthol cigarettes,

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:45.958
and that's ra-- well...

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:49.996
I mean, it is...

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.396
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.396 --> 00:03:52.464
Okay. No, wait.

00:03:52.464 --> 00:03:55.301
[ Stammers ] I mean,
it feels ra--

00:03:55.301 --> 00:03:56.903
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.903 --> 00:04:00.105
But is it, like,
all-the-way racist?

00:04:00.105 --> 00:04:02.441
I -- Okay, okay, okay.

00:04:02.441 --> 00:04:04.877
You gotta look at the -- uh...

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:07.580
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.649
[ Sighs ] Yeah,
'cause if I say that,

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:11.450
then that means
the other thing, so,

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:14.120
dicey, dicey, dicey.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.788
Uh...Okay. Wait.

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:16.989
I got it.

00:04:16.989 --> 00:04:19.392
It is racist, because
the other cigarettes

00:04:19.392 --> 00:04:20.760
are, well -- that's different.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.763
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.264
Okay. Wait.

00:04:25.264 --> 00:04:26.265
Okay.

00:04:26.265 --> 00:04:27.633
Yeah, okay, wait, no.

00:04:27.633 --> 00:04:30.203
Not racist, final answer.

00:04:30.203 --> 00:04:32.104
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.104 --> 00:04:33.739
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:33.739 --> 00:04:35.541
-Amber Ruffin, everybody!

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.343
-Wait! No, I mean,
maybe it is a little --

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:39.245
-We got a great show
for you tonight.

